 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Tensei Shoujo wa Mazu Ippo kara Hajimetai ~Mamono ga Iru Toka Kiitenai!~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "転生少女はまず一歩からはじめたい～魔物がいるとか聞いてない！～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Reincarnated Girl Wants to Start with the First Step"
   },
   {
    "en": "Taking My Reincarnation One Step at a Time: No One Told Me There Would Be Monsters!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Ichinokura Sarasa has been suffering from a constitution that makes her tired easily. She is reborn in another world, Trilgaea, by a goddess, where she is rejuvenated to the body of a 10-year-old and overcomes her frail constitution! However, she is transported to a mountain full of demons, where she cannot carelessly walk outside?! From the inconvenience of this world to a new life full of hope!",
   "ja": "疲れやすい体質に悩まされてきた一ノ蔵更紗。\n\n「魔力が必要な体質」と判明した彼女は、女神によって異世界トリルガイアに転生させられることに。10歳の肉体に若返り、虚弱体質をも克服！\n\nしかし飛ばされた先は魔物だらけの山で、うかつに外も歩けない!? \n\n不自由だった現世から、希望溢れる新しい人生へ！自立志向の異世界スローライフ！"
  },
